   '''<li><b>4. ask somebody + 疑問詞子句：</b><br>• She asked me <u>who wrote it</u>.<br>• <span style="color:#dc2626;">⚠️ 陷阱：</span>間接問句<b>不倒裝、不加 do/does</b>（✗ asked me who did write it）。</li>''',
